    "body": "Merged main again to resolve conflicts (crates/app/src/project/apply.rs, crates/app/src/project/file.rs: keep both sides). Main took project version v59 for #1056 in the meantime, so this PR's program key moves to v60 (PROJECT_VERSION, the version comments, the decision note and the version guard in tests/program_info.rs); the migration ladder needs no new rewrite. Targeted gate: camcraft-app test build ok; program_info 9, mcp_setup 9, per_op_files 9, setup_post_options 10, project_roundtrip 73, fidelity_copies 6, one_wcs 8 passed; clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings clean. Merge-time refresh by the maintainer's merging session; a review of the refreshed head follows.\n",
